# INVWINEC.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: a refusal in
# the middle of a command on every row of the item list, the 260 items
# of INVWIN_WINSEEDEC, item 50 installed in item 1
# (TEST/KEYS/ALLPART.REQ).  Move with all chosen moves items 1 to 49 to
# Shelf A1 and stops at item 50, which is installed: the failure's box
# says where and how many were done, 49 of 260, and the list, fetched
# again once, shows the 49 at A1, item 50 and those after it where they
# were, its focus row alone chosen.  Install in item 2 with all chosen
# installs item 1 and stops at item 2 itself, 1 of 260; Take out to
# Office takes item 1 out and stops at item 2, not installed, 1 of 260.
# The end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINEC.SNP is its snapshot;
# TEST/selchk.py checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER CTRL-SLASH ALT-C M
T A1
K ENTER
S MOVESTOP
K ENTER
S MOVEHALT
K PGDN PGDN
S MOVEPG3
K CTRL-SLASH ALT-C I
S ASKIN
T 2
K ENTER
S INSTOP
K ENTER HOME
S INSTHALT
K CTRL-SLASH ALT-C T
T OFF
K ENTER
S OUTSTOP
K ENTER HOME
S OUTHALT
K ALT-F X
